      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1949474435133522263",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1949474435133522263",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1949474435133522263",
      "text": "[3:14PM] #Mushin #Oshodi #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic across Mushin and its adjoining routes remains calm and steady, with good movement throughout the area. There is smooth flow from Moshalasi through Alakara Police Station, Idi Oro, all the way down to Olosha. Similarly, traffic along Regina Mundi moving towards Ojuwoye is flowing well.\n\nThe corridor from Post Office through AP, Olorunshogo, Challenge, Ilupeju Bypass, and down to Oshodi Underbridge inward Arena is recording good movement. The return journey from Bolade Oshodi, Brown Junction, and onward to Goro and Oshodi Underbridge is also moving efficiently.\n\nOshodi Oke descending by Terminal 2 remains free, while the route underneath the bridge ascending Oshodi Oke by Terminal 1 is in good condition. The axis covering Olupese, Cappa, and Ilupeju Bypass is experiencing no delays.\n\nMovement from Olorunshogo AP through Ladipo Junction and onward to Ojuwoye is seamless. Similarly, traffic from Ojuwoye connecting Isolo Road, Onilegogoro, Palm Avenue, Oye Roundabout, and towards Daleko Bridge inward LASUTECH is steady. The return stretch from Daleko Bridge heading back through Mushin to Ile Epo Isale is also has good movement.\n\nTraffic from Total Filling Station Mushin towards LUTH Junction, Olosha, Idi Oro, and back to Moshalasi is flowing as expected. Our officers are actively present and managing the flow effectively. No major impediments have been reported in the area.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
