    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1949481038478033404",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1949481038478033404",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1949481038478033404",
      "text": "[3:42PM] #Egbeda_IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic along Goye inward Danco on the Lagos-Abeokuta Expressway is moving smoothly at this time. However, there is some slow-moving traffic observed from Access Bank by Araromi up to Iyana Ipaja Underbridge. The return journey along this same stretch remains fast-moving and unproblematic. \n\nAt Alagba, both the ascending and descending sections of the overhead bridge inward Iyana Ipaja Roundabout are experiencing steady but manageable traffic flow, which remains encouraging.\n\nTraffic from Iyana Ipaja Roundabout through Mosalasi Roundabout and onward to Baruwa Junction is flowing well, with a slight delay noted within the Baruwa Roundabout area. The return journey along the same route back to Iyana Ipaja Roundabout is also moving smoothly.\n\nFrom Mosalasi Roundabout heading toward Isheri Roundabout via Egbeda Intersection, traffic remains free in both directions, with no significant delays.\n\nNo impediments is observed across the areas at present.\n#FollowLASTMA",
