    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1949495209290764618",
      "url": "https://x.com/hydcitypolice/status/1949495209290764618",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/hydcitypolice/status/1949495209290764618",
      "text": "𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰 𝗔𝗱𝘃𝗶𝘀𝗼𝗿𝘆\n\nIn view of the Kingdom movie pre-release event at Yousufguda Police Lines (5 PM–10 PM), heavy public turnout is expected near Kotla Vijaya Bhaskar Reddy (KVBR) Stadium. Moderate traffic congestion likely. Commuters are advised to avoid the area and take alternate routes.\n\n𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰 𝗗𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀:\n\n1. Jubilee Hills Checkpost → KVBR Stadium: Diverted at Krishna Nagar Jn. via Srinagar Colony – Panjagutta.\n\n2. Maitrivanam → Jubilee Hills/Madhapur: Diverted at Yousufguda Basti via RBI Quarters – Krishna Nagar – Jubilee Hills Checkpost.\n\n3. Maitrivanam → Borabanda: Diverted at Savera Function Hall via Krishnakanth Park – Kalyan Nagar – Borabanda.\n\n4. Borabanda → Maitrivanam: Diverted via Prime Garden – Midland Bakery – GTS Colony – ICICI U-turn – Maitrivanam.\n\n𝗣𝘂𝗯𝗹𝗶𝗰 𝗣𝗮𝗿𝗸𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗔𝗿𝗲𝗮𝘀:\n\n• Metro Parking (Janakamma Thota 1 & 2), Yousufguda.\n\n• Savera Function Hall & Mahamood Function Hall (4-wheelers only).\n\n𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗰𝘁: For assistance, call Traffic Helpline 9010203626. Follow @HYDP on Twitter and Hyderabad Traffic Police on Facebook for live updates.\n\n𝗣𝗹𝗲𝗮𝘀𝗲 𝗰𝗼𝗼𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗛𝘆𝗱𝗲𝗿𝗮𝗯𝗮𝗱 𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰 𝗣𝗼𝗹𝗶𝗰𝗲.",
